  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1202.03 Actual VOC emission rate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1202.03 \"Actual VOC emission rate\" means the mass of VOCs actually emitted by a source, process, or device per unit throughput, where the throughput is stated in terms of either solvent usage or other quantifiable production variable.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
